📁 Data Folder Ke Liye .gitkeep
Kyunki .gitignore me backend/data/ ignore ho raha hai, lekin folder structure GitHub pe dikhni chahiye, isliye .gitkeep files banao:

powershell
# PowerShell me ye chalao
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "backend/data/.gitkeep" -Force
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "backend/data/logs/.gitkeep" -Force
Aur .gitignore me last me ye add karo (taki .gitkeep ignore na ho):

gitignore
# Keep folder structure
!backend/data/.gitkeep
!backend/data/logs/.gitkeep
