New-Item -ItemType File -Path "backend/data/.gitkeep" -Force
New-Item -ItemType File -Path "backend/data/logs/.gitkeep" -Force

# ===== 3. Pehle se tracked sensitive files hatao =====
git rm --cached backend/.env
git rm --cached frontend/.env
git rm --cached backend/data/maos.db
git rm --cached backend/data/logs/app.log

# ===== 4. Sab add karo =====
git add .
git add .gitignore
git add backend/data/.gitkeep
git add backend/data/logs/.gitkeep

# ===== 5. Commit =====
git commit -m "chore: update .gitignore and remove sensitive files"

# ===== 6. Push =====
git push -u origin main
🔍 Verify Karo Ki .gitignore Kaam Kar Raha Hai
Chalane ke baad ye command:

powershell
git status
Ye files list me NAHI dikhni chahiye:

❌ backend/.env

❌ frontend/.env

❌ backend/data/maos.db

❌ backend/data/logs/app.log

❌ node_modules/

❌ __pycache__/

Ye files DIKHNI chahiye (untracked/added):

✅ .gitignore

✅ .env.example

✅ backend/data/.gitkeep

✅ backend/data/logs/.gitkeep

Aur ye command se check karo ki file ignore ho rahi hai ya nahi:

powershell
git check-ignore -v backend/.env
Expected output:

text
.gitignore:15:backend/.env    backend/.env
Matlab .gitignore sahi kaam kar raha hai ✅

🆘 Agar Phir Bhi .env Dikh Raha Hai git status me
Kyunki wo pehle se tracked hai. Iska matlab git rm --cached nahi chala:

powershell
# Force remove from tracking
git rm -r --cached backend/.env
git rm -r --cached frontend/.env
git rm -r --cached backend/data/maos.db
git rm -r --cached backend/data/logs/app.log

git commit -m "fix: fully remove sensitive files from tracking"
git push origin main
✅ FINAL CHECKLIST
□ Root .gitignore file me upar wala content daala
□ backend/data/.gitkeep banayi
□ backend/data/logs/.gitkeep banayi
□ .env files untrack ki
□ maos.db untrack ki
□ app.log untrack ki
□ git add . chalaya
□ Commit kiya
□ Push kiya
□ GitHub pe verify kiya — .env nahi dikh rahi
Bhai, ab bas ye kaam karo. Agar koi error aaye to exact error message paste karo, main turant fix bataunga.

Bolo — .gitignore ban gaya? 🚀



# ============================================
# MAOS Project - .gitignore
# Enterprise Multi-Agent Operating System
# ============================================

# ============================================
# PYTHON
# ============================================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# Virtual Environments
venv/
env/
ENV/
.venv/
.ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/
pythonenv*

# PyInstaller
*.manifest
*.spec

# Unit test / coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
.cache
nosetests.xml
coverage.xml
*.cover
*.py,cover
.hypothesis/
.pytest_cache/
cover/

# ============================================
# ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (VERY IMPORTANT!)
# ============================================
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
backend/.env
frontend/.env
*.env
!.env.example

# ============================================
# DATABASE
# ============================================
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
backend/data/*.db
backend/data/*.sqlite3
backend/data/chroma_db/
backend/data/vectorstore/

# ============================================
# LOGS
# ============================================
*.log
logs/
backend/data/logs/*.log
backend/data/logs/*.txt

# ============================================
# NODE / REACT / FRONTEND
# ============================================
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Build output
dist/
dist-ssr/
build/
.vite/
.next/
out/

# Vite cache
.vite-cache/
node_modules/.vite/

# Environment
.env.production.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local

# ============================================
# IDE / EDITORS
# ============================================
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.project
.classpath
.settings/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# ============================================
# OS FILES
# ============================================
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ============================================
# STREAMLIT / GRADIO (if used)
# ============================================
.streamlit/
.gradio/

# ============================================
# LANGGRAPH / AI FRAMEWORKS
# ============================================
.langgraph/
.langchain/
checkpoints/
*.checkpoint
*.pkl
*.pickle

# ============================================
# TEMPORARY / CACHE
# ============================================
tmp/
temp/
.cache/
.temp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp

# ============================================
# JUPYTER NOTEBOOKS
# ============================================
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb_checkpoints

# ============================================
# DOCKER
# ============================================
docker-compose.override.yml
.docker/
*.dockerfile.bak

# ============================================
# MISC
# ============================================
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache
